{
  "review": "I was trying to work out why I loved this movie?? It's not because of the money spent on it for sure! Did I see a painted water pistol there? Maybe they don't have the same kind of visual effects in Scotland? Or maybe they just didn't have any money? The making process clearly shows a group of very determined guys creating a movie against the odds. Awesome! But what really impressed me was the grittiness of the performances. Mike Michell and Patrick White play the lead roles like two regular people. No Hollywood grandstanding here.",
