{
  "review": "As a SCUBA diver, I appreciate the incredible physical strain the cameramen experienced while recording underwater. This series is much more than that, though. The narration is flawless, the scenes bordering on implausible, and the subject matter captivating. The daily struggles for life outside our view are mind-boggling. This DVD set has opened my eyes to another planet right here on Earth. I strongly recommend watching this series.",
  "translate": "Come un SCUBA diver, ammetto di apprezzare la straordinaria fatica física degli operai sotterrani per ottenere le fotografie sotto l'acqua. Questa serie è molto altro di ciò. La narrazione è perfetta, i ritagli si avvicinano al paradigma e il soggetto interestante. Il struggle giornaliero per la vita, non visibile dal nostro punto di vista terrestre, è straordinariamente affascinante. Questo insieme VHS ha aperto i miei occhi su un altro pianeta qui su Earth. Seguitemi a farlo amare.",
  "sentiment": "positive"
}

{
  "review": "Well, i rented this movie and found out it realllllllly sucks. It is about that family with the stepmother and the same stupid fights in the family,then the cool son comes with his stupid camera and he likes to take a photo to damaged building and weird things and weird movie ,and then he asks his father to take him to a side trip and simply agrees, etc etc etc..... They go to that town which no one know it exists (blah blah blah) And the most annoying thing is that the movie ends and yet you don't understand what is THAT MOVIE!!!!I have seen many mystery movies but that was the worst, Honestly it doesn't have a description at all and i wish i didn't see it.",
